{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Timeborn",
    "steam_appid": 3571630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/extras/f2d0e3b7fb65f8add3e9cf331fba0776.avif?t=1747438074\" width=604 height=91 /></span><strong>Timeborn</strong> is a <i>JRPG</i> inspired game where you explore a world where time has long since ceased and destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to rid this world of the <i>void-beings</i> that have began to grow aggressive ever since the <i>Gilded Tower</i> arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is a classic <i>turn based</i> system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes including <i>stopping time</i> to unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights you can explore a variety of environments such as a foggy forest, a dark city, and a clock tower gilded in gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games visuals are <i>2.5d</i> where <i>pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models</i> are used to create a variety of detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/extras/f2d0e3b7fb65f8add3e9cf331fba0776.avif?t=1747438074\" width=604 height=91 /></span><strong>Timeborn</strong> is a <i>JRPG</i> inspired game where you explore a world where time has long since ceased and destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to rid this world of the <i>void-beings</i> that have began to grow aggressive ever since the <i>Gilded Tower</i> arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is a classic <i>turn based</i> system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes including <i>stopping time</i> to unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights you can explore a variety of environments such as a foggy forest, a dark city, and a clock tower gilded in gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games visuals are <i>2.5d</i> where <i>pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models</i> are used to create a variety of detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Fight the void-beings that are infesting this perpetuated time. Use your power over time and the elements to destroy any opponent and find the truth behind this worlds permanent stasis.",
